osrs-icons

Game assets
-----------
The images and data published by this project (item icons, skill and equipment-slot sprites, stack
tables) are extracted from the Old School RuneScape game cache. Old School RuneScape and all of its
assets are the property of Jagex Ltd. No ownership is claimed. They are provided unmodified in
substance (re-encoded, scaled 2x) for use by non-commercial fan tools, in the spirit of Jagex's fan
content guidelines. For takedown or questions, open an issue at
https://github.com/RedFirebreak/osrs-icons/issues.

Cache source
------------
Game caches are downloaded from the OpenRS2 Archive (https://archive.openrs2.org).

